  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab w/ 4 Full-Size Doors (Not for Quad Cab)\nFeatures\nPerfect Fitment: Engineered specifically for 2019–2026 Ram 1500 Crew Cab models with four full-size doors (not compatible with Quad Cab or Classic body style). Be sure to refer to the cab diagram before purchasing to confirm proper fit.\nFunctional & Stylish Design: Featuring a 3.5-inch step-down profile, these running boards provide convenient vehicle access without compromising ground clearance—ideal for daily commutes and off-road adventures alike.\nDurable Protective Finish: Coated in a triple-layer textured black finish, the nerf bars offer superior resistance to rust, UV rays, wear, and slipping. Their sleek structure also contributes to improved fuel economy through better airflow.\nReinforced Steel Structure: Crafted from high-strength carbon steel and shaped into a robust triangular tube, these side steps offer outstanding durability and support up to 400 lbs.\nSimple Bolt-On Setup: Comes with all required mounting brackets (6 total), hardware, and easy-to-follow instructions. No drilling or cutting is needed—installation can be completed in approximately 20 minutes using standard tools.\nProfessional installation recommended",
